Get Deposit History

Retrieves deposit transaction history with optional filtering by coin,
status, and time range. Converts \code{insertTime} timestamps to POSIXct.
\subsection{API Endpoint}{

\verb{GET https://api.binance.com/sapi/v1/capital/deposit/hisrec}
}

\subsection{Official Documentation}{

\href{https://developers.binance.com/docs/wallet/capital/deposite-history}{Binance Deposit History}
Verified: 2026-05-22
}

\subsection{Automated Trading Usage}{
\itemize{
\item \strong{Deposit Monitoring}: Poll for status \code{1} (success) deposits to trigger trading logic
when funds arrive.
\item \strong{Reconciliation}: Match \code{tx_id} against on-chain transaction hashes for audit.
\item \strong{Time-Windowed Queries}: Use \code{startTime}/\code{endTime} to retrieve deposits within a
specific period. Max range is 90 days.
}
}

